<h2 id="indesign-grep-咒語">indesign GREP 咒語</h2>
<p>用 GREP 揣著漢字邊仔的所有空白符號</p>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>(?&lt;=~K)\s+|\s+(?=~K)
</code></pre><p>用 GREP 揣著所有的羅馬字佮數字</p>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>[a-zA-Z\x{00C0}-\x{024F}\x{0300}-\x{030D}\x{0358}\x{207F}\x{1D3A}0-9-]+
</code></pre><div class="footnotes" role="doc-endnotes">
<hr>
